{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender LibBlock Linking.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender LibBlock Linking.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender lib block linking blender lib block linking","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender LibBlock Linking.md","fileName":"Blender LibBlock Linking.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender LibBlock Linking","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 00:20\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Blender DNA and File Loading]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender DNA and File Loading","Blender Main Database","Blender Blend File Version Conversion","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender LibBlock Linking.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender LibBlock Linking.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender lib block linking blender lib block linking","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender LibBlock Linking.md","fileName":"Blender LibBlock Linking.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender LibBlock Linking","heading":"Blender LibBlock Linking","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"LibBlock linking turns converted blend-file records into connected Blender objects. For each ordinary block, `read_libblock()` reads the current-version structure, restores directly owned data through a type-specific `direct_link_*()` routine, and identifies the datablock through its `ID` header.\n\nAfter direct data is repaired, `lib_link_all()` resolves relationships among datablocks and joins the results into the [[Blender Main Database]]. This staged approach separates [[Blender Blend File Version Conversion]] from pointer restoration and makes both memory-based and file-based loads follow the same logic.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender DNA and File Loading","Blender Main Database","Blender Blend File Version Conversion","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender LibBlock Linking.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender LibBlock Linking.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender lib block linking blender lib block linking","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender LibBlock Linking.md","fileName":"Blender LibBlock Linking.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender LibBlock Linking","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender DNA and File Loading","Blender Main Database","Blender Blend File Version Conversion","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}